BT 1 0 0 1 0 34.5 Tm 15 TL /F1 10.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Batch Apex processes large numbers of records in small chunks. This batch finds all ) Tj /F2 10.5 Tf (Pending) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf ( orders) Tj T* (and confirms the ones whose vehicle still has stock. The class implements) Tj T* /F5 10.5 Tf (Database.Batchable) Tj (<) Tj (sObject) Tj (>) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf ( and has three methods: ) Tj /F2 10.5 Tf (start) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf (, ) Tj /F2 10.5 Tf (execute) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf ( and ) Tj /F2 10.5 Tf (finish) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf (.) Tj T* ET
